---
import LegalLayout from '@/layouts/LegalLayout.astro';
import { site } from '@/data/site';
import { FIND_A_DOCTOR_URL } from '@/data/privia';
---
<!-- VERIFY with Privia legal before launch: governing law and venue (Maryland assumed), limitation of liability wording, and consistency with Privia's own website terms. -->

<LegalLayout title="Terms of Use" description="The rules for using the Pain Management Specialists website." lead="By using this website, you agree to these terms. If you do not agree, please do not use the site.">
  <div class="callout"><p><strong>In an emergency, call 911.</strong> This website is not for emergencies or urgent medical needs. If you have severe pain, trouble breathing, chest pain, weakness or numbness that is new or sudden, or loss of bladder or bowel control, call 911 or go to the nearest emergency room.</p></div>

  <h2>About this website</h2>
  <p>This website is run for {site.name}, a care center of Privia Medical Group. We may change or remove content at any time.</p>

  <h2>Information only, not medical advice</h2>
  <p>The pages on this site explain conditions and treatments in general terms. They are for education. They are not medical advice, a diagnosis or a treatment plan. Reading this site does not create a doctor-patient relationship. Only a physician who has examined you can advise you about your care. Results of treatment differ from person to person.</p>

  <h2>Booking and patient accounts</h2>
  <p>You can choose a provider and schedule a visit with <a href={FIND_A_DOCTOR_URL} target="_blank" rel="noopener">Find-A-Doctor</a>. The patient portal and mobile app are run by Privia, and their own terms apply there. Do not share your login with anyone.</p>

  <h2>How you may use the site</h2>
  <p>You agree not to:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>break the law or help anyone else break it;</li>
    <li>try to get into our systems, or disrupt or overload the site;</li>
    <li>use bots or scrapers to copy the site in bulk;</li>
    <li>pretend to be someone else, or send harmful code.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Our content and trademarks</h2>
  <p>The text, images, logos and design on this site belong to us, Privia or our licensors, and are protected by law. The Privia and Pain Management Specialists names and logos are trademarks. You may view and print pages for your own personal use. You may not copy or reuse them for other purposes without written permission.</p>

  <h2>Links and third-party content</h2>
  <p>We link to other websites and show third-party content such as maps. We do not control them and are not responsible for them.</p>

  <h2>No warranties</h2>
  <p>We work to keep the site accurate and available, but we provide it “as is” and “as available.” We do not promise it will always be complete, current, error-free or uninterrupted.</p>

  <h2>Limits on our responsibility</h2>
  <p>To the extent the law allows, we are not responsible for indirect or consequential losses that come from using this website. Nothing here limits any rights you have that cannot be limited by law, and nothing limits responsibility for the medical care you receive from our physicians.</p>

  <h2>Privacy and cookies</h2>
  <p>Please read our <a href="/privacy-policy">Privacy Policy</a> and <a href="/cookie-policy">Cookie Policy</a>. Your health information is protected as described in our <a href="/hipaa">HIPAA and Your Privacy Rights</a> page.</p>

  <h2>Accessibility</h2>
  <p>We want everyone to be able to use this site. See our <a href="/accessibility">Accessibility Statement</a> or call us if you need help.</p>

  <h2>Changes to these terms</h2>
  <p>We may update these terms. If you keep using the site after a change, you accept the new terms. We update the “Last updated” date when we do.</p>

  <h2>Governing law</h2>
  <p>These terms are governed by the laws of the State of Maryland, without regard to its conflict-of-law rules.</p>

  <h2>Contact us</h2>
  <p>Questions about these terms? Call <a href={`tel:${site.phone.tel}`}>{site.phone.display}</a>.</p>
</LegalLayout>
